<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "When you are kicked from a channel, a dialog appears with the details."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_options}>{dgettext("help_features", "Dialog Contents")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The dialog shows the channel name, who kicked you, and the reason if one was given."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_kick}>{dgettext("help_features", "Multiple Kicks")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "If you are kicked from multiple channels simultaneously, the dialogs queue and display one at a time. Click OK to dismiss each dialog."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_options}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "What the Dialog Looks Like")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The window is titled Kicked from Channel. It names the channel, then lists By, with the operator's nickname, and Reason, when one was given. A note at the bottom says that the channel tab was closed."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "What Else Happens")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The channel tab closes, and you stop receiving its messages."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Everyone in the channel sees a line saying who kicked you, with the reason if one was given."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The kick sound plays, unless you have muted sounds. You can pick a different sound for kicks in the Sounds window."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "If you are identified and the channel is in your auto-join list, it is removed from that list."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Going Back")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A kick is not a ban. You can usually join again right away with the command below. If an operator also banned you, the join is refused."
  )}
</p>
<pre>/join #channel</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-unread-indicators">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Unread Indicators")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-kick">/kick</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-join">/join</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-sounds">{dgettext("help_features", "Sounds")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-auto-join-channels">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Auto-Join Channels")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
